// "Soldevi Digger" — `Selection::TopOfGraveyard` fixture: a single-card
// ordered graveyard peek/move, no other grammar. Volrath's Shapeshifter (the
// task's originally-named TopOfGraveyard fixture) also exercises the
// primitive, but its "has the full text of that card" clause needs a
// text-changing/copy-effect Modification this repo has not built yet
// (2008-08-01 ruling: "not a copy effect" — a bespoke text-changing
// mechanism, not `BecomeCopyOf`) — swapped for this simpler, fully-renderable
// real card.
Normal(
  name: "Soldevi Digger",
  mana_cost: [
    Generic(2),
  ],
  types: [
    Artifact,
  ],
  abilities: [
    Activated(
      cost: [Mana([Generic(2)])],
      effect: Each(
        binder: Existing(TopOfGraveyard(count: 1)),
        effect: Move(It, Library(FromBottom(0))),
      ),
    ),
  ],
)
